  "description": "Take the agility and swiftness of a premium racing bike and add geometry designed for all-day comfort in the saddle, and you've got the Addict 30. It's a dream road bike for riders addicted to performance potential but who favor a more relaxed riding position.\n\nOn the ride, Addict 30’s geometry feels fast but comfortable. Stack is taller and reach is shorter compared to racing numbers, so you won’t feel pretzeled into the frame. The frame delivers vertical compliance you’ll feel in its supple ride quality pedaling over harsh road surfaces. Addict 30 fits up to 38mm tires, giving you an all-road-like unlock to explore mixed-surface routes and unmaintained frontage roads with confidence and stability as you roll over the rough stuff.\n\nAddict 30 is a highly versatile road bike that hedges the lines between performance road and all-road capacity, and we've specced it with workhorse components that flit between the lines just as well. Shimano's 105 Di2 electric 2x drivetrain delivers performance and reliability at a more accessible price, and Syncros Capital 1.0 wheels on Schwalbe ONE tires give a quick and confident roll anywhere you take your ride.\n\nPlease note that bike specifications are subject to change without prior notice.",
